    "steam_appid": 2402540,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402540/extras/aab31419d613217195f158f3061b2576.avif?t=1741753147\" /></span>\u2261[\u3002\u3002]\u2261 Crabby never cry, Rock n\u2019 Roll never die! Crab Rhapsody (Vol.1) is an action-roguelite game with unique stylized art and original interactive music. Accidentally caught up in the kidnapping incident at a music festival, the music lover Crabby decides to do something! Duo-wielding bizarre battle instruments with claws, forming powerful live battle band, rescue music and hope from the forces of evil at dangerous Abyseas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More info about the game and development is coming soon!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402540/extras/aab31419d613217195f158f3061b2576.avif?t=1741753147\" /></span>\u2261[\u3002\u3002]\u2261 Crabby never cry, Rock n\u2019 Roll never die! Crab Rhapsody (Vol.1) is an action-roguelite game with unique stylized art and original interactive music. Accidentally caught up in the kidnapping incident at a music festival, the music lover Crabby decides to do something! Duo-wielding bizarre battle instruments with claws, forming powerful live battle band, rescue music and hope from the forces of evil at dangerous Abyseas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More info about the game and development is coming soon!</p>",
    "short_description": "\u2261[\u3002\u3002]\u2261 Crabby never cry, Rock n\u2019 Roll never die! Crab Rhapsody vol.1 is a crab action-roguelite game. Build cute crab battle live-band, upgrade duo-wielding instrument weapons, and rescue the world of music.",
